<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In UserLM-R1: Modeling Human Reasoning in User Language Models with Multi-Reward Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Adversarial Dataset</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS1" title="In Appendix C Adversarial Dataset ‣ UserLM-R1: Modeling Human Reasoning in User Language Models with Multi-Reward Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.1 </span>Dataset Construction</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS2" title="In Appendix C Adversarial Dataset ‣ UserLM-R1: Modeling Human Reasoning in User Language Models with Multi-Reward Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.2 </span>Detailed Evaluation Results</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
